+	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS && ARM64 && SAMSUNG_EXYNOS_SMC_ARM64
+	default n
+	help
+	  Expose read-only CP_CTRL_S and CP_CTRL_NS values through sysfs using
+	  Samsung's secure-monitor read service. No secure-monitor call is made
+	  at module load; reads happen only when a sysfs attribute is accessed.
+	  This driver does not change CP power, reset, firmware, or mailbox state.
 endif
